# A tree that checks clean: the root, a section, a submodule and a test module
# (docs/modules-style-pass.md).
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod words
mod Geometry
test mod tests
use Ui
use Geometry.*

@main: @unit
@main:
    Ui.Label(text=$"{Name (Double 2)}")
